    "body": "Only a couple changes that I think must (heh) be changed before merging, viz. the grammar issues. My other comments, on cases that might be best elevated to a non-note, or the cases where I express my sadness that we can't talk about normative requirements very well inside notes, are not blocking this PR.\r\n\r\nIn general I think it'd be best to say we can't talk about a normative requirement (using the magic words) inside notes, simply because that would allow us to add a lint check to catch this going forward. It's a little unnatural in those cases but that's a small price to pay for avoiding this clearly-easy-to-mess-up issue going forward.",
